  "suggestions": "Start with a Jazzmaster-style neck pickup, guitar tone around 6–8 and volume around 7–9. Play lightly for the spacious phrases; raise guitar volume or pick harder for a little edge. These guitar-control positions are suggested starting points, not documented settings from the recording.",
